Package: sentinelscan
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-requests, python3-urllib3
Recommends: python3-dnspython
Description: Industrial-grade modular web security scanner
 SentinelScan scans web targets for misconfigurations, insecure headers,
 TLS/SSL issues, cookie flaws, CORS vulnerabilities, DNS email-security
 gaps, exposed ports (with banner grabbing), passive subdomain enumeration,
 multi-page header-consistency crawling, and known-vulnerable software
 version fingerprinting.
 .
 Supports an external plugin system, CI/CD exit-code gating, nmap-style
 timing templates, and text/JSON/HTML/SARIF report output.
